"""
================================================HELP=MESSAGE============================================================
AaShell> proc -h

NAME:
    CC&S Shell proc command
    Prints list of running processes

USAGE:
    proc [options]
    -h        Prints command help
    -v        Prints running processes information verbosely
    -p name   Prints information only for processes matching given name pattern
    -c        Prints running processes and commands installed in each process
    -c name   Prints running processes and installed commands matching given name pattern
    -s        Makes '-c' and '-c name' short
    -i        Makes '-p name' and '-c name' case insensitive

EXAMPLES:
    proc
    proc -h
    proc -v
    proc -p CCS
    proc -i -p ccs
    proc -c
    proc -c -p CCS
    proc -c msg
    proc -i -c msg
    proc -s -i -c msg
    proc -s -i -c msg -p ccs

AaShell>
"""
